    gFloorC_Ffactor,              !- Name
    1.26363,                      !- F-Factor {W/m-K}
    77.65845299,                  !- Area {m2}  Derived from: the area of the floor polygon of the surface g Floor C (77.659356 m2 = 835.918 ft2 from the vertex coordinates; the value of this field differs by 0.000903 m2 (0.0012 %)).
    3.352599999999999;            !- PerimeterExposed {m}  Derived from: the sum of the bottom edges of the 2 exterior walls that stand on the floor of the zone (g WWall C, g EWall C): 1.6763 + 1.6763 = 3.352636 m.

